WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.369 --> 00:00:09.884
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hey! Look out!

2
00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:14.065
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi. I have a reservation for four nights.

3
00:00:14.065 --> 00:00:15.942
My name is Ben Fischer.

4
00:00:16.031 --> 00:00:17.288
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Are you on holiday?

5
00:00:17.572 --> 00:00:20.087
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No. I’m a student.

6
00:00:20.477 --> 00:00:21.717
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Bye, Mr Fischer.

7
00:00:22.372 --> 00:00:28.165
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Ben…My name’s Ben…Wait, what’s your name?

8
00:02:45.764 --> 00:02:48.067
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> Good afternoon, Ben.

9
00:02:48.456 --> 00:02:50.546
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Sorry I’m late.

10
00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:56.711
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> The class starts at nine o’clock.

11
00:02:59.881 --> 00:03:01.582
It’s half past nine.

12
00:03:03.159 --> 00:03:04.735
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m really sorry.

13
00:03:15.044 --> 00:03:17.011
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> Sleeping in class.

14
00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:21.049
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I…Sorry, Andre.

15
00:03:22.342 --> 00:03:23.848
I’m really tired.

16
00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:28.648
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> Can I see some of your work?

17
00:03:39.525 --> 00:03:41.048
These are really…

18
00:03:42.695 --> 00:03:45.211
great, Ben.

19
00:03:47.744 --> 00:03:49.533
Yeah, I like these.

20
00:03:50.224 --> 00:03:52.597
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Oh. Thank you.

21
00:03:59.381 --> 00:04:01.082
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> These are good too.

22
00:04:12.401 --> 00:04:15.341
But these…are nothing special.

23
00:04:19.894 --> 00:04:21.913
Look, I know it’s difficult,

24
00:04:24.411 --> 00:04:27.918
but I don’t want good photos.

25
00:04:28.786 --> 00:04:30.734
I want great photos.

26
00:04:30.734 --> 00:04:32.382
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> OK, Andre.

27
00:04:33.214 --> 00:04:38.174
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> My job is to teach you how to take great photos.

28
00:04:40.512 --> 00:04:42.957
More photos like these.

29
00:04:49.511 --> 00:04:52.717
I don’t want photos like these.

30
00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:57.925
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> OK. Sure, Andre.

31
00:04:58.935 --> 00:04:59.749
Thanks.

32
00:05:01.928 --> 00:05:04.337
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> Go and have a coffee and wake up.